OL,3,GNEWSADaughter wins #127k claim for
OL,4,Acaring for mum at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has described her "phenomenal"
OL,7,Frelief after she won a legal case that
OL,8,Fmeans she is entitled to be paid for
OL,9,Fcaring for her elderly mother in her
OL,10,Ffinal years.
OL,12,FBern Rogers, from Bristol, told the BBC
OL,13,Fof the "harrowing and deeply sad"
OL,14,Ffamily dispute since her elderly mother
OL,15,FSheila died in 2020, which even led to
OL,16,Fher facing criminal charges.
OL,18,FLegal experts said the "hugely
OL,19,Fsignificant" High Court ruling would
OL,20,Flead to other claims.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
